，趙有平原，楚有春申，魏有信陵。此四君者，皆明知而忠信，寬厚而愛人，尊賢重士，約從離衡，并韓、魏、燕、楚、齊、趙、宋、衛、中山之眾。於是六國之士有寧越、徐尚、蘇秦、杜赫之屬為之謀，齊明、周最、陳軫、昭滑、樓緩、翟景、蘇厲、樂毅之徒通其意，吳起、孫臏、帶佗、兒良、王廖、田忌、廉頗、趙奢之朋制其兵。常以十倍之地，百萬之眾，叩關而攻秦。秦人開關延敵，九國之師逡巡遁逃而不敢進。秦無亡矢遺鏃之費，而天下諸侯已困矣。於是從散約解，爭割地而奉秦。秦有餘力而制其敝，追亡逐北，伏尸百萬，流血漂櫓。因利乘便，宰割天下，分裂河山，彊國請服，弱國入朝。延及孝文王、莊襄王，享國日淺，國家無事。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"孟嘗","kind":"person","person_id":"7pl_s0g_rkh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"平原","kind":"person","person_id":"lz2_9j4_p17","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"春申","kind":"person","person_id":"epj_utq_pyg","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0103","start":103,"end":105,"surface":"信陵","kind":"person","person_id":"o4b_bje_i31","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"四君者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"泛稱、群體或未核指代，不據引文譬喻補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"寧越","kind":"person","person_id":"ccx_50c_ssi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p064:block05:m0166","start":166,"end":168,"surface":"徐尚","kind":"perso